    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, if the logs show the carrier handled it fine/didn't drop it, why would we do a partial refund or replacement? If we keep doing this when the logs say we aren't at fault, we're basically just paying for customers to break stuff at home. Are you sure we shouldn't just deny the claim and tell them the data shows no shipping damage?",
